        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Craig\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/48/2150_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Craig:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Or you can do what I did. Pester them for three years until they give you a job.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I plan to take hostages next time they come to England, that's sure to get me all the secrets I want.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>And a helicopter.</p>",
