        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Ronway\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/48/1856_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Ronway:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<div><b>Foote wrote:</b><br><blockquote>That could have been anybody Cap was trying to save. Why Matty?\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nCould of really been anybody?Note in that same picture, her and Progeny of the same colored glow in their eyes. In the recent update on Sentinel Conflict, there is a picture of The Matriarch, with the glowing eyes.<a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/story-war-sentinel-conflict-and-cosmic-contest-com/postsProgeny\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/story-war-sentinel-conflict...</a> can also be seen with the same glowing eyes in other pictures. Couldn't this mean they have some kind of connection? So the reason as to why it was The Matriarch is most likely, the mask. After all it does hold more power than we have yet to learn.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yup. This is consistent with my old theory of Matty being tied to the big bad.</p>",
        "post_number": 28,
